<td>(<i><a href="/wiki/Consolidated_city-county" title="Consolidated city-county">Consolidated<br />city-borough</a></i>)</td>
<td>Unified Home Rule</td>
<td>1971</td>
<td>-</td>
<td>Derived from <a href="/wiki/Tlingit_people" class="mw-redirect" title="Tlingit people">Tlingit</a> word <i><b>Shee At'iká</b></i>, meaning "People on the outside of Shee (<a href="/wiki/Baranof_Island" title="Baranof Island">Baranof Island</a>)."</td>
<td>2.91
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003835500000000000♠">8,355</span>
ARIZONA
</td>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Apache_County,_Arizona" title="Apache County, Arizona">Apache&#32;County</a>
</th>
