</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Flagstaff,_Arizona" title="Flagstaff, Arizona">Flagstaff</a></td>
<td>1891</td>
<td>Yavapai County</td>
<td><i>Coconino</i> is a former designation for the <a href="/wiki/Havasupai_people" class="mw-redirect" title="Havasupai people">Havasupai</a>, <a href="/wiki/Hualapai_people" class="mw-redirect" title="Hualapai people">Hualapai</a>, and/or <a href="/wiki/Yavapai_people" class="mw-redirect" title="Yavapai people">Yavapai</a>, derived from the <a href="/wiki/Hopi_language" title="Hopi language">Hopi</a> <a href="/wiki/Exonym" class="mw-redirect" title="Exonym">exonym</a> <i>Kohonino</i>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005145161000000000♠">145,161</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004186610000000000♠">18,661</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7004483320000000000♠">48,332</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
