<td>1881</td>
<td>Maricopa and Pinal Counties</td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Gila_River" title="Gila River">Gila River</a>, a <a href="/wiki/Tributary" title="Tributary">tributary</a> of the <a href="/wiki/Colorado_River" title="Colorado River">Colorado</a>. Possibly from <a href="/wiki/Western_Apache_language" title="Western Apache language">Apache</a> <i>dzil</i> "mountain," via Spanish <i>Xila</i>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004540730000000000♠">54,073</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003479600000000000♠">4,796</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7004124220000000000♠">12,422</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
