</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Safford,_Arizona" title="Safford, Arizona">Safford</a></td>
<td>1881</td>
<td>Apache and Pima Counties</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Mount_Graham" title="Mount Graham">Mount Graham</a>, in the <a href="/wiki/Pinale%C3%B1o_Mountains" title="Pinaleño Mountains">Pinaleños</a>. Mt. Graham itself is named for <a href="/wiki/Corps_of_Topographical_Engineers" class="mw-redirect" title="Corps of Topographical Engineers">topographical engineer</a> <a href="/wiki/James_Duncan_Graham" title="James Duncan Graham">James Duncan Graham</a> (1799-1865).<sup id="cite_ref-10" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-10"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>10<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004402420000000000♠">40,242</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003464100000000000♠">4,641</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7004120200000000000♠">12,020</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Arizona_highlighting_Graham_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Graham County"><img alt="State map highlighting Graham County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Map_of_Arizona_highlighting_Graham_County.svg/120px-Map_of_Arizona_highlighting_Graham_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="100" height="123" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Map_of_Arizona_highlighting_Graham_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Arizona_highlighting_Graham_County.svg.png 1.5x" data-file-width="893" data-file-height="1099" /></a></span>
