<td>Yuma County</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/La_Paz,_Arizona" title="La Paz, Arizona">La Paz, Arizona</a>, a historic boomtown on the <a href="/wiki/Colorado_River" title="Colorado River">Colorado River</a>. A <a href="/wiki/La_Paz_(disambiguation)" class="mw-disambig" title="La Paz (disambiguation)">common placename</a>, <i>La Paz</i> means "The Peace" in Spanish.
</td>
