<td>1871</td>
<td>Pima and Yavapai Counties</td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Maricopa_people" title="Maricopa people">Maricopa</a> (<i>Piipaash</i>) people. First attested in Spanish as <i>Cocomaricopa</i>, no origin or meaning is definitively known.
</td>
