</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Kingman,_Arizona" title="Kingman, Arizona">Kingman</a></td>
<td>1864</td>
<td>—</td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Mohave_people" title="Mohave people">Mohave</a> (<i>Aha Makhav</i>) people. The <a href="/wiki/Mohave_language" class="mw-redirect" title="Mohave language">Mohave</a> <a href="/wiki/Endonym" class="mw-redirect" title="Endonym">endonym</a> means "along the water," referring to the <a href="/wiki/Colorado_River" title="Colorado River">Colorado</a>.<sup id="cite_ref-12" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-12"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>12<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005226479000000000♠">226,479</span>
