<td>1895</td>
<td>Apache County</td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Navajo_people" class="mw-redirect" title="Navajo people">Navajo</a> (<i>Diné</i>) people. <i>Navajo</i> is an <a href="/wiki/Exonym" class="mw-redirect" title="Exonym">exonym</a> from <a href="/wiki/Tewa_language" title="Tewa language">Tewa</a> <i>Navahu</i> "big field," referring to the <a href="/wiki/San_Juan_River_(Colorado_River)" class="mw-redirect" title="San Juan River (Colorado River)">San Juan River Valley</a>
</td>
