<td>Derived from <a href="/wiki/Monterey_Bay" title="Monterey Bay">Monterey Bay</a>, which was named for a Viceroy of New Spain, <a href="/wiki/Gaspar_de_Z%C3%BA%C3%B1iga,_5th_Count_of_Monterrey" title="Gaspar de Zúñiga, 5th Count of Monterrey">Gaspar de Zúñiga, 5th Count of Monterrey</a></td>
