</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Ventura,_California" title="Ventura, California">Ventura</a></td>
<td>1872</td>
<td>Santa Barbara</td>
<td>The city of Ventura, derived from <a href="/wiki/Mission_San_Buenaventura" title="Mission San Buenaventura">Mission San Buenaventura</a> (Spanish for <a href="/wiki/St._Bonaventure" class="mw-redirect" title="St. Bonaventure">St. Bonaventure</a>)</td>
<td>General Law
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005835427000000000♠">835,427</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003184600000000000♠">1,846</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7003478100000000000♠">4,781</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_California_highlighting_Ventura_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Ventura County"><img alt="State map highlighting Ventura County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Map_of_California_highlighting_Ventura_County.svg/120px-Map_of_California_highlighting_Ventura_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="100" height="115" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Map_of_California_highlighting_Ventura_County.svg/250px-Map_of_California_highlighting_Ventura_County.svg.png 1.5x" data-file-width="916" data-file-height="1054" /></a></span>
<p><br />
