<td><a href="/wiki/Pagosa_Springs,_Colorado" title="Pagosa Springs, Colorado">Pagosa Springs</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001885-04-14-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Apr 14, 1885</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Conejos_County,_Colorado" title="Conejos County, Colorado">Conejos County</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Colorado_General_Assembly" title="Colorado General Assembly">Colorado State Senator</a> <a href="/wiki/Antonio_D._Archuleta" title="Antonio D. Archuleta">Antonio D. Archuleta</a> and his father, José Manuel Archuleta.
