<td><a href="/wiki/Springfield,_Colorado" title="Springfield, Colorado">Springfield</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001889-04-16-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Apr 16, 1889</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Las_Animas_County,_Colorado" title="Las Animas County, Colorado">Las Animas County</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of pioneer and <a href="/wiki/Colorado_General_Assembly" title="Colorado General Assembly">Colorado territorial legislator</a> Felipe Baca.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003336700000000000♠">3,367</span>
