<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Jerome_B._Chaffee" title="Jerome B. Chaffee">Jerome Bunty Chaffee</a>, one of <a href="/wiki/Colorado" title="Colorado">Colorado</a>'s first two <a href="/wiki/U.S._Senator" class="mw-redirect" title="U.S. Senator">U.S. Senators</a> from 1876 to 1879.
