<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/Cheyenne_Nation" class="mw-redirect" title="Cheyenne Nation">Cheyenne Nation</a> of <a href="/wiki/Native_American_(U.S.)" class="mw-redirect" title="Native American (U.S.)">Native Americans</a>.
