</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Ordway,_Colorado" title="Ordway, Colorado">Ordway</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001911-05-29-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">May 29, 1911</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Otero_County,_Colorado" title="Otero County, Colorado">Otero County</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Colorado_General_Assembly" title="Colorado General Assembly">Colorado State Senator</a> John H. Crowley.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003560000000000000♠">5,600</span>
</td>
