<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Custer_County,_Colorado" title="Custer County, Colorado">Custer&#32;County</a>
</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/08027,00">027</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Westcliffe,_Colorado" title="Westcliffe, Colorado">Westcliffe</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001877-03-09-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Mar 9, 1877</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Fremont_County,_Colorado" title="Fremont County, Colorado">Fremont County</a>.</td>
<td>Named in memory of <a href="/wiki/George_Armstrong_Custer" title="George Armstrong Custer">George Armstrong Custer</a>, (1839–1876), the U.S. Army <a href="/wiki/Colonel_(United_States)" title="Colonel (United States)">colonel</a> defeated and killed at the <a href="/wiki/Battle_of_the_Little_Bighorn" title="Battle of the Little Bighorn">Battle of the Little Bighorn</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003555300000000000♠">5,553</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7002739240000000000♠">739.24</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7003191500000000000♠">1,915</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Custer_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Custer County"><img alt="State map highlighting Custer County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Custer_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Custer_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="150" height="109" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Custer_County.svg/330px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Custer_County.svg.png 2x" data-file-width="1558" data-file-height="1128" /></a></span>
