</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Delta,_Colorado" title="Delta, Colorado">Delta</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001883-02-11-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Feb 11, 1883</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Gunnison_County,_Colorado" title="Gunnison County, Colorado">Gunnison County</a>.</td>
<td>Named for the town of <a href="/wiki/Delta,_Colorado" title="Delta, Colorado">Delta</a> located at the <a href="/wiki/River_delta" title="River delta">delta</a> of the <a href="/wiki/Uncompahgre_River" title="Uncompahgre River">Uncompahgre River</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004322150000000000♠">32,215</span>
</td>
