<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Delta_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Delta County"><img alt="State map highlighting Delta County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Delta_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Delta_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="150" height="109" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Delta_County.svg/330px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Delta_County.svg.png 2x" data-file-width="1558" data-file-height="1128" /></a></span>
<p><br />
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/City_and_County_of_Denver,_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="City and County of Denver, Colorado">City and County of Denver</a>
</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/08031,00">031</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Denver,_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Denver, Colorado">Denver</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001902-12-01-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Dec 1, 1902</span></td>
<td>The original <a href="/wiki/Arapahoe_County,_Colorado" title="Arapahoe County, Colorado">Arapahoe</a> <a href="/wiki/County_seat" title="County seat">County Seat</a> was split from <a href="/wiki/Arapahoe_County,_Colorado" title="Arapahoe County, Colorado">Arapahoe</a> and the newly-created <a href="/wiki/Adams_County,_Colorado" title="Adams County, Colorado">Adams Counties</a>, and reorganized as a <a href="/wiki/Consolidated_city-county" title="Consolidated city-county">consolidated city and county</a>.</td>
<td>Named to curry favor with <a href="/wiki/James_W._Denver" title="James W. Denver">James W. Denver</a>, <a href="/wiki/Governor" title="Governor">Governor</a> of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Kansas" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Kansas">Territory of Kansas</a> from 1857 to 1859.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005729019000000000♠">729,019</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7002155660000000000♠">155.66</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7002403000000000000♠">403</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Denver_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting City and County of Denver"><img alt="State map highlighting City and County of Denver" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Denver_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Denver_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="150" height="109" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Denver_County.svg/330px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Denver_County.svg.png 2x" data-file-width="1558" data-file-height="1128" /></a></span>
<p><br />
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
