</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Dove_Creek,_Colorado" title="Dove Creek, Colorado">Dove Creek</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001881-03-04-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Mar 4, 1881</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Ouray_County,_Colorado" title="Ouray County, Colorado">Ouray County</a>.</td>
<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/Dolores_River" title="Dolores River">Dolores River</a>, which was originally named <i>el Rio de Nuestra Senora de los Dolores</i>, which is Spanish for <i>the River of our Lady of Sorrows</i>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003246700000000000♠">2,467</span>
</td>
