<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Dolores_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Dolores County"><img alt="State map highlighting Dolores County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Dolores_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Dolores_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="150" height="109" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Dolores_County.svg/330px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Dolores_County.svg.png 2x" data-file-width="1558" data-file-height="1128" /></a></span>
<p><br />
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Douglas_County,_Colorado" title="Douglas County, Colorado">Douglas&#32;County</a>
