</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Castle_Rock,_Colorado" title="Castle Rock, Colorado">Castle Rock</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001861-11-01-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Nov 1, 1861</span></td>
<td>Created as one of the 17 original counties of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Stephen_A._Douglas" title="Stephen A. Douglas">Stephen Arnold Douglas</a>, (1813–1861), <a href="/wiki/U.S._Senator" class="mw-redirect" title="U.S. Senator">U.S. Senator</a> from <a href="/wiki/Illinois" title="Illinois">Illinois</a> from 1847 to 1861.
</td>
