</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Eagle,_Colorado" title="Eagle, Colorado">Eagle</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001883-02-11-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Feb 11, 1883</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Summit_County,_Colorado" title="Summit County, Colorado">Summit County</a>.</td>
<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/Eagle_River_(Colorado)" title="Eagle River (Colorado)">Eagle River</a> which originates in the county.
</td>
