<td>Created as one of the 17 original counties of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/John_C._Fr%C3%A9mont" title="John C. Frémont">John Charles Frémont</a> (1813–1890), the explorer, U.S. Army general, and <a href="/wiki/U.S._Senator" class="mw-redirect" title="U.S. Senator">U.S. Senator</a> from <a href="/wiki/California" title="California">California</a>.
