<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/William_Gilpin_(governor)" title="William Gilpin (governor)">William Gilpin</a>, the first <a href="/wiki/Governor_of_Colorado" title="Governor of Colorado">Governor</a> of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.
