<td><span data-sort-value="000000001874-02-10-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Feb 10, 1874</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Lake_County,_Colorado" title="Lake County, Colorado">Lake</a>, <a href="/wiki/Conejos_County,_Colorado" title="Conejos County, Colorado">Conejos</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Costilla_County,_Colorado" title="Costilla County, Colorado">Costilla</a> counties.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/George_A._Hinsdale" title="George A. Hinsdale">George Aaron Hinsdale</a>, a Lieutenant Governor of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7002747000000000000♠">747</span>
</td>
