<td><a href="/wiki/Walsenburg,_Colorado" title="Walsenburg, Colorado">Walsenburg</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001861-11-01-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Nov 1, 1861</span></td>
<td>Created as one of the 17 original counties of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.</td>
<td>Named for <a href="/wiki/Huerfano_Butte" title="Huerfano Butte">Huerfano Butte</a>, a solitary volcanic plug.  <i>Huérfano</i> is a Spanish word meaning <i>orphan</i>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003698800000000000♠">6,988</span>
</td>
