<td><span data-sort-value="000000001909-05-05-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">May 5, 1909</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Larimer_County,_Colorado" title="Larimer County, Colorado">Larimer County</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Andrew_Jackson" title="Andrew Jackson">Andrew Jackson</a> (1767–1845), the seventh <a href="/wiki/President_of_the_United_States" title="President of the United States">President of the United States</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003127300000000000♠">1,273</span>
</td>
