</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Golden,_Colorado" title="Golden, Colorado">Golden</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001861-11-01-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Nov 1, 1861</span></td>
<td>Created as one of the 17 original counties of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.</td>
<td>Named for its extralegal predecessor county, <a href="/wiki/Jefferson_County,_Jefferson_Territory" title="Jefferson County, Jefferson Territory">Jefferson County, Jefferson Territory</a>, which in turn was named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Thomas_Jefferson" title="Thomas Jefferson">Thomas Jefferson</a> (1743–1826), the author of the <a href="/wiki/United_States_Declaration_of_Independence" title="United States Declaration of Independence">Declaration of Independence</a> and the third <a href="/wiki/President_of_the_United_States" title="President of the United States">President of the United States</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005578533000000000♠">578,533</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7002772850000000000♠">772.85</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7003200200000000000♠">2,002</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
