<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Bent_County,_Colorado" title="Bent County, Colorado">Bent County</a>.</td>
<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/Kiowa_Nation" class="mw-redirect" title="Kiowa Nation">Kiowa Nation</a> of <a href="/wiki/Native_Americans_in_the_United_States" title="Native Americans in the United States">Native Americans</a>.
</td>
