<td><span data-sort-value="000000001861-11-01-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Nov 1, 1861</span></td>
<td>Created as one of the 17 original counties of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.  Renamed <a href="/wiki/Carbonate_County,_Colorado" title="Carbonate County, Colorado">Carbonate County</a> for the two days from February 8–10, 1879.</td>
<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/Twin_Lakes,_Lake_County,_Colorado" title="Twin Lakes, Lake County, Colorado">Twin Lakes</a> in the county.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003736900000000000♠">7,369</span>
