<td>Created as one of the 17 original counties of the <a href="/wiki/Territory_of_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Territory of Colorado">Territory of Colorado</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/William_Larimer" class="mw-redirect" title="William Larimer">William Larimer</a>, a pioneer entrepreneur.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005374574000000000♠">374,574</span>
