<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/Purgatoire_River" title="Purgatoire River">Purgatoire River</a>, which was originally named <i>el Rio de las Animas Perdidas</i>, which is Spanish for <i>the River of the Souls in Purgatory</i>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004145180000000000♠">14,518</span>
</td>
