<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Abraham_Lincoln" title="Abraham Lincoln">Abraham Lincoln</a> (1809–1865), the sixteenth <a href="/wiki/President_of_the_United_States" title="President of the United States">President of the United States</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003559800000000000♠">5,598</span>
