<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/John_A._Logan" title="John A. Logan">John Alexander Logan</a> (1826–1886), a U.S. Army general and <a href="/wiki/U.S._Senator" class="mw-redirect" title="U.S. Senator">U.S. Senator</a> from <a href="/wiki/Illinois" title="Illinois">Illinois</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004207550000000000♠">20,755</span>
