<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Gunnison_County,_Colorado" title="Gunnison County, Colorado">Gunnison County</a>.</td>
<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/Mesa" title="Mesa">mesa</a> formations which are widespread through the area.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005161260000000000♠">161,260</span>
</td>
