</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/08079,00">079</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Creede,_Colorado" title="Creede, Colorado">Creede</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001893-03-27-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Mar 27, 1893</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Hinsdale_County,_Colorado" title="Hinsdale County, Colorado">Hinsdale</a>, <a href="/wiki/Rio_Grande_County,_Colorado" title="Rio Grande County, Colorado">Rio Grande</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Saguache_County,_Colorado" title="Saguache County, Colorado">Saguache</a> counties.</td>
<td>Named from the plentiful <a href="/wiki/Mineral" title="Mineral">mineral</a> deposits found in the area.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7002933000000000000♠">933</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7002878160000000000♠">878.16</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7003227400000000000♠">2,274</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
