</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Craig,_Colorado" title="Craig, Colorado">Craig</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001911-02-27-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Feb 27, 1911</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Routt_County,_Colorado" title="Routt County, Colorado">Routt County</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of railroad pioneer <a href="/wiki/David_H._Moffat" class="mw-redirect" title="David H. Moffat">David H. Moffat</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004131420000000000♠">13,142</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003475585999999999♠">4,755.86</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7004123180000000000♠">12,318</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Moffat_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Moffat County"><img alt="State map highlighting Moffat County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Moffat_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Moffat_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="150" height="109" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Moffat_County.svg/330px-Map_of_Colorado_highlighting_Moffat_County.svg.png 2x" data-file-width="1558" data-file-height="1128" /></a></span>
<p><br />
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
