<td><span data-sort-value="000000001889-04-16-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Apr 16, 1889</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/La_Plata_County,_Colorado" title="La Plata County, Colorado">La Plata County</a>.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Aztec" class="mw-redirect" title="Aztec">Aztec</a> leader <a href="/wiki/Moctezuma_II" title="Moctezuma II">Moctezuma II</a>.  Ruins in the area were once thought to be Aztec.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004268410000000000♠">26,841</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003203580000000000♠">2,035.80</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7003527300000000000♠">5,273</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
