<td><span data-sort-value="000000001877-01-18-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Jan 18, 1877</span></td>
<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Hinsdale_County,_Colorado" title="Hinsdale County, Colorado">Hinsdale</a> and <a href="/wiki/Lake_County,_Colorado" title="Lake County, Colorado">Lake</a> counties.  Renamed <a href="/wiki/Uncompaghre_County,_Colorado" class="mw-redirect" title="Uncompaghre County, Colorado">Uncompaghre County</a> for four days from 1883-02-27, to 1883-03-02.</td>
<td>Named in honor of <a href="/wiki/Chief_Ouray" class="mw-redirect" title="Chief Ouray">Ouray</a>, a <a href="/wiki/Ute_Tribe" class="mw-redirect" title="Ute Tribe">Ute</a> <a href="/wiki/Native_American_(U.S.)" class="mw-redirect" title="Native American (U.S.)">Native American</a> leader.
</td>
