<td>Split from <a href="/wiki/Garfield_County,_Colorado" title="Garfield County, Colorado">Garfield County</a>.</td>
<td>Named for the <a href="/wiki/White_River_(Green_River)" class="mw-redirect" title="White River (Green River)">White River</a>, which was originally named <i>Rio Blanco</i> in Spanish.
