<td>Name comes from a <a href="/wiki/Ute_language" class="mw-redirect" title="Ute language">Ute language</a> noun meaning "sand dunes".<sup id="cite_ref-Saguache_14-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-Saguache-14"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>c<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id="cite_ref-Sawup_15-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-Sawup-15"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>12<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003667000000000000♠">6,670</span>
