<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Former_counties">Former counties</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_counties_in_Florida&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Former counties"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>Fayette County was created in 1832 from the portion of <a href="/wiki/Jackson_County,_FL" class="mw-redirect" title="Jackson County, FL">Jackson County</a> east of the <a href="/wiki/Chipola_River" title="Chipola River">Chipola River</a>, with its county seat at <a href="/w/index.php?title=Ochesee,_Florida&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="Ochesee, Florida (page does not exist)">Ochesee</a> (now in <a href="/wiki/Calhoun_County,_FL" class="mw-redirect" title="Calhoun County, FL">Calhoun County</a> east of <a href="/wiki/Altha,_FL" class="mw-redirect" title="Altha, FL">Altha</a>).<sup id="cite_ref-14" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-14"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>14<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id="cite_ref-15" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-15"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>15<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup> In 1834, it was merged back into Jackson County.<sup id="cite_ref-16" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-16"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>16<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Renamed_counties">Renamed counties</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_counties_in_Florida&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Renamed counties"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>Five counties in Florida have been renamed. Most renamings occurred between 1845 and 1861, during the first sixteen years of Florida's statehood. One occurred in 1997, when Dade County changed its name to <a href="/wiki/Miami-Dade_County,_Florida" title="Miami-Dade County, Florida">Miami-Dade County</a>.
</p>
