<td><a href="/wiki/Alfred,_Maine" title="Alfred, Maine">Alfred</a></td>
<td>1652</td>
<td>As Yorkshire County, Massachusetts, from the southern part of the <a href="/wiki/District_of_Maine" title="District of Maine">District of Maine</a>. Renamed <i><a href="/wiki/York_County,_Massachusetts" title="York County, Massachusetts">York County</a></i> by Massachusetts in 1668</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/York" title="York">York</a>, <a href="/wiki/England" title="England">England</a>, the birthplace of <a href="/wiki/Christopher_Levett" title="Christopher Levett">Christopher Levett</a> who first attempted to settle the area.
</td>
