<td>One of four original counties created in the <a href="/wiki/Massachusetts_Bay_Colony" title="Massachusetts Bay Colony">Massachusetts Bay Colony</a>. Government abolished in 1999.<sup id="cite_ref-sec-state_4-7" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-sec-state-4"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>4<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup></td>
