<td>1818</td>
<td>From part of Wayne County. Was named Michilimackinac County until 1837.</td>
<td>Originally <i><a href="/wiki/Michilimackinac" title="Michilimackinac">Michilimackinac</a></i>, believed to be a French interpretation of the Native American name for <a href="/wiki/Mackinac_Island" title="Mackinac Island">Mackinac Island</a>, meaning "big turtle"
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004111440000000000♠">11,144</span>
