<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Duchesne_County,_Utah" title="Duchesne County, Utah">Duchesne&#32;County</a>
</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/49013,00">013</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Duchesne,_Utah" title="Duchesne, Utah">Duchesne</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001915-01-04-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Jan 4, 1915</span></td>
<td>Part of <a href="/wiki/Wasatch_County,_Utah" title="Wasatch County, Utah">Wasatch County</a></td>
<td>Uncertain; likely origins are a <a href="/wiki/Ute_tribe" class="mw-redirect" title="Ute tribe">Ute</a> word translated "dark canyon", the <a href="/wiki/French_and_Indian_War" title="French and Indian War">French and Indian War</a> site of <a href="/wiki/Fort_Duquesne" title="Fort Duquesne">Fort Duquesne</a> (the county's initial settlement was also a fortress), the corrupted name of an area Indian chief, the name of <a href="/wiki/Society_of_the_Sacred_Heart" title="Society of the Sacred Heart">Society of the Sacred Heart</a> founder <a href="/wiki/Rose_Philippine_Duchesne" title="Rose Philippine Duchesne">Rose Philippine Duchesne</a>, the name of French geographer <a href="/wiki/Andr%C3%A9_Duchesne" title="André Duchesne">André Duchesne</a>, or the name of French fur trapper and explorer Du Chasne<sup id="cite_ref-24" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-24"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>24<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004208030000000000♠">20,803</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003324100000000000♠">3,241</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7003839400000000000♠">8,394</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Utah_highlighting_Duchesne_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Duchesne County"><img alt="State map highlighting Duchesne County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Map_of_Utah_highlighting_Duchesne_County.svg/120px-Map_of_Utah_highlighting_Duchesne_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="100" height="125" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Map_of_Utah_highlighting_Duchesne_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Utah_highlighting_Duchesne_County.svg.png 1.5x" data-file-width="891" data-file-height="1113" /></a></span>
