<td>Part of <a href="/wiki/Great_Salt_Lake_County,_Utah_Territory" class="mw-redirect" title="Great Salt Lake County, Utah Territory">Great Salt Lake</a> and <a href="/wiki/Green_River_County,_Utah_Territory" class="mw-redirect" title="Green River County, Utah Territory">Green River</a> counties<sup id="cite_ref-41" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-41"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>41<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup></td>
<td>High elevations in the county, which includes 39 of Utah's highest peaks<sup id="cite_ref-42" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-42"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>42<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
