</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Heber_City,_Utah" title="Heber City, Utah">Heber City</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001862-01-17-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Jan 17, 1862</span></td>
<td>Part of <a href="/wiki/Great_Salt_Lake_County,_Utah_Territory" class="mw-redirect" title="Great Salt Lake County, Utah Territory">Great Salt Lake</a>, <a href="/wiki/Green_River_County,_Utah_Territory" class="mw-redirect" title="Green River County, Utah Territory">Green River</a>, <a href="/wiki/Sanpete_County,_Utah_Territory" class="mw-redirect" title="Sanpete County, Utah Territory">Sanpete</a>, <a href="/wiki/Summit_County,_Utah_Territory" class="mw-redirect" title="Summit County, Utah Territory">Summit</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Utah_County,_Utah_Territory" class="mw-redirect" title="Utah County, Utah Territory">Utah</a> counties<sup id="cite_ref-47" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-47"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>47<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup></td>
<td>A Native American word meaning "mountain pass", also the name of the <a href="/wiki/Wasatch_Range" title="Wasatch Range">Wasatch Range</a><sup id="cite_ref-48" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-48"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>48<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004378580000000000♠">37,858</span>
