<td><a href="/wiki/Wayne_County,_Tennessee" title="Wayne County, Tennessee">Wayne County, Tennessee</a><sup id="cite_ref-wayne_50-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-wayne-50"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>50<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003260800000000000♠">2,608</span>
