</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Ogden,_Utah" title="Ogden, Utah">Ogden</a></td>
<td><span data-sort-value="000000001850-01-31-0000" style="white-space:nowrap">Jan 31, 1850</span></td>
<td>Original county of <a href="/wiki/State_of_Deseret" title="State of Deseret">State of Deseret</a></td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Weber_River" title="Weber River">Weber River</a>, a 125 miles (201&#160;km) tributary of the Great Salt Lake<sup id="cite_ref-51" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-51"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>51<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
