<td>Formed from parts of <a href="/wiki/Bath_County,_Virginia" title="Bath County, Virginia">Bath</a> and <a href="/wiki/Botetourt_County,_Virginia" title="Botetourt County, Virginia">Botetourt</a> counties as well as <a href="/wiki/Monroe_County,_West_Virginia" title="Monroe County, West Virginia">Monroe County</a> (now in WV)</td>
