</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Amherst_County,_Virginia" title="Amherst County, Virginia">Amherst&#32;County</a>
</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/51009,00">009</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Amherst,_Virginia" title="Amherst, Virginia">Amherst</a></td>
<td>1761</td>
<td>From <a href="/wiki/Albemarle_County,_Virginia" title="Albemarle County, Virginia">Albemarle</a> county</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Jeffery_Amherst" class="mw-redirect" title="Jeffery Amherst">Jeffery Amherst</a>, British conqueror of <a href="/wiki/Quebec" title="Quebec">Quebec</a> during the <a href="/wiki/Seven_Years%27_War" title="Seven Years&#39; War">Seven Years' War</a> and colonial governor of Virginia
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004316500000000000♠">31,650</span>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7002475000000000000♠">475</span>&#160;sq&#160;mi<br />(<span data-sort-value="7003123000000000000♠">1,230</span>&#160;km<sup>2</sup>)</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Virginia_highlighting_Amherst_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Amherst County"><img alt="State map highlighting Amherst County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Map_of_Virginia_highlighting_Amherst_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Virginia_highlighting_Amherst_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="150" height="65" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Map_of_Virginia_highlighting_Amherst_County.svg/330px-Map_of_Virginia_highlighting_Amherst_County.svg.png 2x" data-file-width="2495" data-file-height="1082" /></a></span>
</td></tr>
