</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Arlington,_Virginia" class="mw-redirect" title="Arlington, Virginia">Arlington</a></td>
<td>1846</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/District_of_Columbia_retrocession" title="District of Columbia retrocession">Annexed from</a> the <a href="/wiki/District_of_Columbia" class="mw-redirect" title="District of Columbia">District of Columbia</a>, having previously been part of Fairfax County prior to the district's formation</td>
