</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Warm_Springs,_Virginia" title="Warm Springs, Virginia">Warm Springs</a></td>
<td>1791</td>
<td>From Augusta, Botetourt and Greenbrier counties May 1, 1791</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Bath,_Somerset" title="Bath, Somerset">Bath, England</a>
</td>
