<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/51021,00">021</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Bland,_Virginia" title="Bland, Virginia">Bland</a></td>
<td>1861</td>
<td>From <a href="/wiki/Giles_County,_Virginia" title="Giles County, Virginia">Giles</a>, <a href="/wiki/Tazewell_County,_Virginia" title="Tazewell County, Virginia">Tazewell</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Wythe_County,_Virginia" title="Wythe County, Virginia">Wythe</a> counties</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Richard_Bland" title="Richard Bland">Richard Bland</a>, member of the <a href="/wiki/Continental_Congress" title="Continental Congress">Continental Congress</a> and publisher of the <a href="/wiki/American_Revolutionary_War" title="American Revolutionary War">American Revolutionary War</a>-era tract <i>An Inquiry into the Rights of the British Colonies</i>
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003618600000000000♠">6,186</span>
