</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Botetourt_County,_Virginia" title="Botetourt County, Virginia">Botetourt&#32;County</a>
</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/51023,00">023</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Fincastle,_Virginia" title="Fincastle, Virginia">Fincastle</a></td>
<td>1770</td>
<td>From <a href="/wiki/Augusta_County,_Virginia" title="Augusta County, Virginia">Augusta</a> county.</td>
