</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Nottoway_County,_Virginia" title="Nottoway County, Virginia">Nottoway&#32;County</a>
</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/51135,00">135</a>
