<td>From the area of <a href="/wiki/Amelia_County,_Virginia" title="Amelia County, Virginia">Amelia County</a> called Nottaway Parish</td>
<td>Nodawa tribe
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004156320000000000♠">15,632</span>
