</th>
<td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.census.gov/quickfacts/table/PST045215/56013,00">013</a>
</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Lander,_Wyoming" title="Lander, Wyoming">Lander</a></td>
<td>1884</td>
<td>Part of Sweetwater County.</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/John_C._Fr%C3%A9mont" title="John C. Frémont">John C. Frémont</a> <small>(1813–90)</small>, explorer, <a href="/wiki/United_States_Senate" title="United States Senate">U.S. Senator</a> for <a href="/wiki/California" title="California">California</a>, and the first presidential candidate of a major party to run on a platform in opposition to slavery
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004397210000000000♠">39,721</span>
</td>
