<td>1911</td>
<td>Part of Laramie County.</td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Land_of_Goshen" title="Land of Goshen">Land of Goshen</a>, a <a href="/wiki/Biblical" class="mw-redirect" title="Biblical">Biblical</a> paradise.
</td>
