<td>Parts of Carbon County and Sweetwater County.</td>
<td>Edward P. Johnson <small>(1843–1879)</small>, a lawyer from <a href="/wiki/Cheyenne,_Wyoming" title="Cheyenne, Wyoming">Cheyenne, Wyoming</a>. (Initial name, Pease County, named for E. L. Pease, President of the Territorial Legislative Council.)<sup id="cite_ref-9" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-9"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>9<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td>
