</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Cheyenne,_Wyoming" title="Cheyenne, Wyoming">Cheyenne</a></td>
<td>1867</td>
<td>One of the original five counties.</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Jacques_La_Ramee" title="Jacques La Ramee">Jacques La Ramee</a> <small>(1785?–1821)</small>, a <a href="/wiki/French-Canadian" class="mw-redirect" title="French-Canadian">French-Canadian</a> <a href="/wiki/Fur_trade" title="Fur trade">fur trapper</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7005101783000000000♠">101,783</span>
