</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Casper,_Wyoming" title="Casper, Wyoming">Casper</a></td>
<td>1888</td>
<td>Part of Carbon County.</td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Natron" title="Natron">natron</a>, or soda deposits found within the county's borders. <i>Natrona</i> means <i>natron</i> in <a href="/wiki/Spanish_language" title="Spanish language">Spanish</a>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7004804100000000000♠">80,410</span>
