<td><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Map_of_Wyoming_highlighting_Natrona_County.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="State map highlighting Natrona County"><img alt="State map highlighting Natrona County" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Map_of_Wyoming_highlighting_Natrona_County.svg/120px-Map_of_Wyoming_highlighting_Natrona_County.svg.png" decoding="async" width="100" height="77" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Map_of_Wyoming_highlighting_Natrona_County.svg/250px-Map_of_Wyoming_highlighting_Natrona_County.svg.png 1.5x" data-file-width="1471" data-file-height="1126" /></a></span>
