</td>
<td><a href="/wiki/Lusk,_Wyoming" title="Lusk, Wyoming">Lusk</a></td>
<td>1911</td>
<td>Part of Converse County.</td>
<td>The <a href="/wiki/Niobrara_River" title="Niobrara River">Niobrara River</a>, which flows through the state. <i>Niobrara</i> is <a href="/wiki/Omaha_(tribe)" class="mw-redirect" title="Omaha (tribe)">Omaha</a> for <i>flat or broad river</i>.
</td>
<td><span data-sort-value="7003230100000000000♠">2,301</span>
